# The image is built with the repository root as its context (see
# app/Dockerfile), so send only what it uses: the app and the changelog.
# Everything else here, including Caddy's data and the stats database when
# they live in this checkout, stays out of the build.
*
!CHANGELOG.md
!app/
app/node_modules
app/ui/node_modules
app/ui/dist
app/public
app/data
**/*.log
